  <ThingDef ParentName="FH_BaseFleshBeast">
    <defName>FH_Furiousmeld</defName>
    <label>furiousmeld</label>
    <description>A colossal amalgamation of dozens of smaller fleshbeasts, bound together by a loosely connected central nervous system. It grows a thick carapace of living iron and can project a spherical bioprotective forcefield that allows bullets to pass out but not in. Furiousmelds rarely appear in raids and can usually only be summoned through rituals. In combat, the furiousmeld charges headlong to destroy defenses, clearing a path for lesser fleshbeasts to overwhelm the enemy.</description>
